---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base
  title="Disclaimer — RepMaths"
  description="Disclaimer for RepMaths fitness, strength, nutrition, and body composition calculators."
>
  <article class="legal-page">
    <h1>Disclaimer</h1>
    <p>Last updated: September 13, 2026</p>

    <p>
      The calculators on RepMaths use established, published formulas
      and methods from strength training, exercise science, and sports
      nutrition research. See our
      <a href="/about">Methods &amp; Formulas</a> page for more information.
    </p>

    <p>
      All calculators and information on RepMaths are provided for
      informational and educational purposes only. They are not intended
      to replace professional medical, nutritional, or fitness advice,
      diagnosis, or treatment.
    </p>

    <h2>Estimates, Not Exact Measurements</h2>

    <p>
      Calculator results are estimates based on the information entered
      and the assumptions of the underlying formula or method. Individual
      results may vary, and different formulas can produce different
      estimates from the same inputs.
    </p>

    <p>
      This applies to strength, training, nutrition, hydration, and body
      composition tools. Results such as estimated one-rep max, calorie
      needs, protein requirements, water intake, or body fat percentage
      should be treated as practical estimates rather than exact
      measurements.
    </p>

    <h2>Nutrition &amp; Health</h2>

    <p>
      Nutrition and body-composition calculators provide general estimates
      intended primarily for healthy adults. Individual needs can differ
      substantially based on age, medical conditions, medications,
      pregnancy, breastfeeding, eating disorders, or other health
      circumstances.
    </p>

    <p>
      Do not use RepMaths calculators as a substitute for individualized
      medical or nutritional guidance. If you have a medical condition,
      are pregnant or breastfeeding, take medication, or have concerns
      about your health or nutrition, consult an appropriately qualified
      healthcare professional.
    </p>

    <h2>Exercise &amp; Training</h2>

    <p>
      Exercise and strength-training calculations are provided for
      informational purposes and do not account for every individual's
      training history, technique, fatigue, injury status, or physical
      limitations.
    </p>

    <p>
      Use appropriate judgment when applying calculated training loads.
      Stop exercising if you experience unusual pain, dizziness, or other
      concerning symptoms, and seek appropriate professional advice when
      necessary.
    </p>

    <h2>Use at Your Own Risk</h2>

    <p>
      By using RepMaths, you acknowledge that its calculators and
      information have limitations and that you are responsible for how
      you use the results.
    </p>

    <p>
      RepMaths is not responsible for injury, health problems, loss, or
      damage resulting from reliance on calculations or information
      provided on this site, to the extent permitted by applicable law.
    </p>

    <p>
      If you are unsure whether a calculator or its result is appropriate
      for your situation, consult a qualified professional.
    </p>
  </article>

  <style>
    .legal-page {
      margin-top: 32px;
    }

    .legal-page h2 {
      font-size: 1.3rem;
      margin-top: 32px;
    }

    .legal-page p {
      line-height: 1.7;
    }

    .legal-page a {
      color: var(--accent);
    }
  </style>
</Base>
